abstract: "PromptDC for Chrome is an optional browser addition to PromptDC for Desktop, the universal AI writing assistant and enhancer for macOS and Windows. Pick or create a profile with your instructions to rewrite selected web text for grammar, emails, replies, summaries, and tone; translate selected messages by naming the target language in an Action or custom profile. Editable fields update in place; read-only results can be copied. The Code profile also rewrites AI coding prompts."

